<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JO PILIPI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Pilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo Pilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Pil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO PILIPI</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ocoyo waraga man bot jo Pilipi i kanica ma en okwongo cakone i lobo Ulaya. Jo Pilipi onongo gin tye ite loc pa jo Roma ma onongo gin loyo lobo me Mekadonia ducu. Paulo ocoyo waraga man ikare ma onongo en tye i buc.</para>
  <para style="ip">En onongo iye pe yom ikom tim pa jo mukene ma onongo dage nono ki dok bene gin pwonyo pwony kilong ma balo tam pa dano ikom Lubanga ki ikanica matye i Pilipi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga man onyutu kamaleng yomcwiny ki gen ma Paulo tye kwede ikom Yecu Kricito pi niyene matuti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo bene opwoyo jo Pilipi pi mot mapol ma gin gucwalo bote ikare ma e tye ki miti.</para>
  <para style="ip">En dong otiyo ki gum me mot man me cuko cwiny jo Pilipi me bedo ki tek cwiny kadi bed en ki gin gitye ki can madwong. En bene olego gin me bedo ki cwiny me mwolo calo pa Yecu Kricito ma kabedo ki miti ki waka madwong.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo opoyo wi Jo Pilipi ni, bedo ki gen ikom Yecu Kricito obedo mot me kica ma Lubanga omiyo ki gin pi niye, ento pe pi lubu Cik pa Lujudaya. Lubanga miyo yomcwiny ki kuc bot jo ma ye Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok madongo matye i buk man en aye yomcwiny matye i Yecu, gen, ribe, ki diyo cwiny, bedo ki niye ma atir ki kwo maber ma lakricitayo omyero obed kwede. Waraga man bene onyutu dok kelo kamaleng lok me yomcwiny, bedo ki gen, ribe ki diyo cwiny ma tye i niye pa lukricitayo ki kwogi. Ki dok nyutu miti matut ma Paulo tye kwede pi kanica matye i Pilipi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Nyutu ngat ma ocoyo waraga man <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit kwo ma Paulo tye iye <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwo i Yecu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1:27—2:18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tam me cwalo Temceo ki Epaprodito bot jo Pilipi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gwoke ikom lumone ki gin maracu <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paulo ki lureme matye i Pilipi <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mot me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:12">Tic 16:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ki Temceo, ma lutic pa Kricito Yecu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Bot jo pa Lubanga ducu matye i Kricito Yecu ma gibedo i Pilipi, kacel ki luneno ki ludikon ma konyogi.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito omiwu kica ki kuc.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Paulo pi jo pa Lubanga matye i Pilipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Apwoyo Lubanga ikare ducu ma nongo atye ka po pirwu. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />I legana ducu alego pirwu ducu ki yomcwiny, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />pien cake inino mukwongo nio kwede wa onyo, wuribe kweda i tic me tito lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Aniang maber ni, Lubanga ma ocako tic man ikinwu bicobo kakare nio wa inino me dwogo pa Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Opore bota me paro pi wun ducu kitmeno, pien pirwu lita tutwal, pien wun ducu wuribe kacel kweda i nywako kica ma Lubanga omiya i buc kany, ki dok ikare ma atye ka laro lok me Kwena Maber wek omok matek. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Lubanga aye cadena ma ngeyo ni, par matut ma abedo kwede pirwu a ki i mar pa Kricito Yecu kikome. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Dok alego Lubanga ni meno, mar mewu omyero odong omede ameda i ngec kikome ki niang matut, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />wek wuyer gin maber makato. Man bimiyo wubedo ma cwinywu leng labongo bal mo inino me dwogo pa Kricito. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Man bene bimiyo kwowu bedo ma opong ki kit tic ducu mabeco pi yewu i Yecu Kricito, kun kelo deyo ki pak bot Lubanga.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bedo kwo en aye Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Utmega, amito wunge ni, lok mutime ikoma okonyo matek me nyayo lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Tic 28:30</ref> </char></note> Man oweko acikari pa Cecar ducu, ki jo mukene bene, kombedi gin ngeyo maber ni, an atye i buc pi Kricito. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Dok utmegiwa mapole gen gi bene omede ikom Rwot pi bedona i buc, omiyo gitito lok pa Lubanga ki tekcwiny madwong tutwal, labongo lworo.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ikom lok ada, jo mogo tito pi Kricito ki cwiny me nyeko ki me daa, ento jo mukene gitito ki cwiny maber. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Jo ma tito ki cwiny maber ni gitito pi mar, kun gingeyo ni Lubanga oketa kany me bedo caden pi lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Jo mukene ca gitito nying Kricito pi laro dito kun nongo cwinygi pe leng, tamgi tye me medo can bota i buc kany. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Lok mo pe, an gira cwinya yom ayoma, pien i yo ducu, kadi i goba nyo lok ada, gitye katito pi Kricito.<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Eyo, pud dok abibedo ki yomcwiny. Pien angeyo maber ni, pi legawu ki pi kony ma a ki bot Cwiny Maleng pa Yecu Kricito, bimiyo abwot ki i can. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Pien mitina ki gena madwong tye ni, lewic pe bimaka i gin mo, ento atamo me miyo deyo bot Kricito ikomani ki tekcwiny madwong, ikare ni macalo ikare ducu, kadi akwo nyo kadi ato. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Pien ki tung bota, bedo kwo en aye Kricito, ki to kono aye dok ber makato ducu. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Ka abedo kwo ikom, miyo abitiyo tic mogo ma konyo ento pe angeyo gin ma abiyero. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Kwanyo acel ikom gin aryoni ocungo wiya woko. Mitina tye ni kono ato wek abed kacel ki Kricito, pien meno aye ber makato ducu. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Ento bedo kwo ikom mite tutwale pirwu. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />An dong aniang i lok man, omiyo angeyo ni pud abibedo, dok abirii botwu wek wumede wuwot anyim, wubed ki yomcwiny i niyewu. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Meno bimiyo wakewu pira i Kricito Yecu bedo dwong tutwal, ka dok adwogo botwu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Gin acel ma pire dit en ene ni, kit kwo me bedowu myero orwate ki gin ma lok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito mito, wek kadi abino me nenowu, nyo kadi abedo bor kwedwu, ka awinyo lok ikomwu, myero ange ni, wucung matek i cwiny acel ki tam acel, kun wulwenyo kacel pi niye ma bino pi lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Pe wuwek lukworwu gumiwu lworo i gin mo. Man aye lanyut ma cimo botgi kamaleng ni kibityekogi woko matwal, ento lanyut man nyutu botwu ni kibilarowu; pien loc man Lubanga aye miyo. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Pien en omiyowu mot me kica pe me ye Kricito keken, ento me neno can pire bene. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Tic 16:19-40</ref> </char></note> Piman wun bene dong wudonyo ikit lweny mayam wuneno ikomani, dok bene kombedi pud wuwinyo ni atye iyeni.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mwolo pa Kricito ki dite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Pimeno, ka wunongo tekcwiny mo pi bedo i Kricito, nyo wunongo diyo cwiny mo ma a ki i mar, nyo ka gimiyowu ribe mo i Cwiny Maleng, nyo cwiny mo me kica nyo cwiny me con ne ma weko itimo ber bot jo mukene, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />dong alegowu ni, wumii yomcwinya ocobe maber kit man: wubed ki tam acel ki mar acel, kun wuribe kacel i cwinywu, ki tamwu bene myero obed acel. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Pe wubed jo ma paro pirwu kenwu makato pi dano mukene ducu, ento wubed ki mwolo, kun dano acel acel woro lawote macalo ngat ma pire tek loye. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Pe itam pi gin ma konyo in keken, ento tam pi gin ma konyo jo mukene bene. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Wubed ki cwiny marom ki cwiny mayam Kricito Yecu obedo kwedeni. <verse eid="PHP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />I kite kadi bed en Lubanga kikome, ento pe oride ki tek me bedo rom ki Lubanga. <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />En oweko meno ducu, ci okwanyo kit me opii, ka kinywale macalo dano. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ka dong okati macalo dano, ci omwole woko gire kene, obedo lawiny nio wa i to, kadi bed bene en oto wa ikom yatariya. <verse eid="PHP 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Pimeno, Lubanga omiye dit mamalo tutwal, dok bene omiye nying matye malo makato nying mukene ducu. <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Ica 45:23</ref> </char></note> Lubanga otimo man wek gigu ducu matye i polo ki i lobo, kadi wa gigu ducu matye piny ite lobo, gurum cong gi piny me woro nying Yecu, <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />ki leb ducu myero otuc bene ni, Yecu Kricito aye Rwot, kun kelo deyo bot Lubanga Won.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ryeny calo dero i lobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Pimeno, wun ma amaro, macalo yam wuwinyo loka ikare ducu ma onongo pud atye botwu, myero wubed ki winy makato kombedi madong atye bor kwedwuni. Wutii tic me cobo larwu kekenwu ki lworo kacel ki myelkom, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />pien Lubanga aye matye katic i cwinywu, kun miyowu miti ki teko me tic, wek wun wuyom cwinye.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Wutii tic ducu labongo nguru nyo pyem mo, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Nwo 32:5</ref> </char></note> wek wubed labongo lok mo maloyowu, ma bal mo bene pe i cwinywu, lutino pa Lubanga ma bal mo pe ikomwu liweng ikin lwak jo me kareni ma gubale wokoni. Wutye ka ryeny i lobo ikin dano calo lakalatwe, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />pien wumako lok me kwo dong matek. Meno bimiyo awake inino me dwogo pa Kricito ni, yam kara onongo pe aringo ngwec nono, dok bene pe ayele nono. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Kadi bed kiony remona me bedo macalo gityer amata ma kionyo iwi keno tyer, kun nongo niyewu kacel ki ticwu bote bedo macalo mot ma kitumu bot Lubanga. Ci an gira cwinya bedo yom kacel ki wun ducu. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Kitmeno, wun bene myero cwinywu obed yom, wek wuribe kweda i yomcwiny.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tam me cwalo Temceo ki Epaprodito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Atye ki gen i Rwot Yecu me cwalo Temceo botwu oyot, wek omii awiny kit ma wutye kwede, kun cuko cwinya bene. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Pe atye ki ngat mo mukene doki matye ki kit cwiny ma en tye kwede, dok matwero paro pirwu adada macalo en. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Jo mukenegu ducu giparo pi gin ma konyogi keken, pe gitamo pi gin ma Yecu Kricito mito. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ento wun wungeyo kit Temceo ki konye ma en onyutu. En ki an wabedo calo wego ki latine; waribe kwede i tic kacel pi lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Pimeno atye ki gen me cwale botwu oyot, tek aniang kit ma pinye tye kawot kwede ki tung bota kany. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Dok bene atye ki gen i Rwot ni an kikoma abio botwu ikare macokcoki.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Atamo bene ni myero acwal omera Epaprodito botwu, ma en latic wadwa ma olwenyo kacel kweda, en ngat mayam wuore bota pi konya i pekonani. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Pien en paro pi wun ducu, kun mito ni enenwu, dok bene cwinye obedo ka cwer matek, pien yam wuwinyo ni kome lit. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Adada, kome onongo obedo lit matek ma obwot to woko. Ento Lubanga okonye, pe en keken, ento kadi wa an bene, wek pe omeda cwercwiny ikom cwercwiny mukene ca. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo amito tutwal ni myero acwale botwu wek wubed ki yomcwiny ka dok wunene, ki an bene pe dong myero abed ki cwercwiny madwong. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Wujole i Rwot ki yomcwiny wun ducu; dok bene wuket deyo ikom jo ma cal kwede. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Pien en yam omiyo kwone adada ma obwot to woko pi tic pa Kricito, wek ecob gin ma orem ikom kony mayam wumiya.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kit ma atir me ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Me agikine, utmega, wubed ki yomcwiny i Rwot. An pe aol gira me nwoyo coyo lok mayam kong acoyo botwu, dok loke twero jukuwu miyo pe wupoto i gin marac.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Wuyab wangwu wunen gwogigu, ma gin lutim maracu, ma gingolo dul kom dano wokoni. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Pien wan aye jo mulire me ada, wan jo ma waworo Lubanga i Cwiny Maleng, dok ma wa wake i Kricito Yecu, kun pe watye ki gen mo ikom gin ma nen ki woko ikom dano. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ento an kikoma onongo bene aromo bedo ki gen macalo meno; kace ngat mo tamo ni etwero bedo ki gen ikom gin ma nen ki woko ikom dano, ci an gira aloye. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tic 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref> </char></note> An gilira inino me aboro me dita, roka jo Icrael ma i kaka pa Benjamin. An Laibru ma jo Ibru aye gunywala. I lok ma dok ikom Cik pa Moses, an abedo Laparicayo. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Tic 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> Lok ma dok ikom keto cwiny, yam alwenyo marac ikom lwak jo ma oye Yecu. Ka dong lok ma dok ikom bedo ki kit atir ma cung i lubu Cik, onongo gire lok mo pe ikoma. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Ento i gin ducu mayam atamo ni konya, kombedi dong anenogi macalo gin ma konygi peke, pi Kricito. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Adada, pe tye gin mo maber makato man en aye ngeyo Rwotwa Yecu Kricito; meno aye gin ma omiyo aneno jami ducu macalo gin ma konygi peke. Pi Kricito omiyo aloke adoko lacan jami ducu, dok anenogi calo yugi, wek anong Kricito, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />ci wek aribe bene kacel kwede. Pe atye ki kit ma atir ma mera kikoma, kadi ki mo ma bino pi lubu Cik bene peke, ento atye ki kit ma atir ma kinongo pi ye Kricito, ma oa ki bot Lubanga kikome, dok ma en miyo pi niye. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Amito ange Kricito, ki tek ma en ocer kwede, amito bene anywak kwede can ma en ociro, adok calo en i tone, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />wek ka twere ao wa i cer ki ikin jo ma oto.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwec me o iwang tol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Pe atye ka waconi dong anongo, nyo ni dong ao ikit ma Lubanga nongo con mito ni abed kwede, ento pud amede ki ngwec anyim kun ateme ki tek me doko calo Kricito Yecu pien en oyera me doko calo en. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Utmega, pe atamo ni dong atyeko nongone; ento tye gin acel keken, en aye ni wiya bedo ka wil i gin mukato angec, kun alaro gin matye anyim calo dano matye i ngwec me pyem. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Aringo acito anyim atir kun akemo tol, wek anong mot, ma en aye lwongo ma Lubanga tye ka lwongowa kwede malo i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Wan ducu jo muteggi myero wabedu ki kit tam meno; dok bene ka tamwu opoke woko i lok mo, Lubanga binyutune botwu. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Gin mamite keken aye ni myero wamede me cung matek i yo madong wao iye.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Kor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11:1</ref></char>
    </note> Utmega, wuribe kacel kun wulubu kita. Wan dong watyeko nyutu botwu lanen ma myero wulubi; wucik wangwu me neno jo ma lubu lanen meno. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Abedo ka titiwu lok man tyen mapol ata, dok bene tin anwoyo tito botwu ki pig wanga ni, tye jo mapol ma kwogi miyo gibedo lukwor me to pa Yecu ikom yatariya. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />I agikine, jo meno gibito woko, pien lubangagi en aye miti me komgi, dok bene ginongo deyogi i gin ma myero omii lewic omakgi, tamgi kemo jami me lobo man keken. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Pien wan anywali me polo; watye ka kuru Lalarwa ma bia ki kunu, en aye Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />En biloko komwa magoro ma to wokoni ci doko calo kome me deyo, kun tiyo ki tek mere ma miye twero me kelo jami ducu ite loce.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s1">Wubed ki yomcwiny i Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Pimeno utmega, ma amaro dok ma aparo pirwu tutwal, wucung matek i Rwot kitmeno, pien wun aye wubedo yomcwinya ki tok wiya me deyo, wun ma luwota, ikit yo eno ma atito botwu dok apwonyowu kwede myero wumede ki ye i kom Rwot kun otimo gin ma kitito botwu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Dong in Euodia ki in Cintuke, alegowu me bedo ki cwiny acel i Rwot. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />In latic lawota me ada, alegi ikony mon magi ba, pien gin bene gulwenyo kacel kweda pi lok me Kwena Maber kacel ki Kelemente bene ki lutic wadiwa mukene ducu, madong gityeko coyo nyinggi woko i buk me kwo.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Wubed ki yomcwiny i Rwot kare ducu. Dok anwoyo waco botwu aye ni, Wubed ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Wuwek dano ducu gunge mwolo ma wutye kwede. Rwot dong cok dwogo. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Pe wubed ki par ikom gin mo, ento i lok ducu wumii Lubanga onge gin ma wumito ilega ki bako dogwu kacel ki miyo pwoc bene. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Man bimiyo kuc pa Lubanga makato ngec pa dano ducu gwoko cwinywu ki tamwu maber i Kricito Yecu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wuket tamwu ikom lok macalo magi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Me agikine, utmega, wuket tamwu ikom lok macalo magi: gin ducu matye ada, gin ducu maromo awora, gin ducu matye atir, gin ducu maleng, gin ducu ma mwonya, gin ducu ma dano pwoyo, ki kit gin ducu maber atika, ma myero me apaka. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Wutii gin ma nene wupwonyo, ma wugamo, ma wuwinyo, dok ma wuneno ki bota; ci Lubanga won kuc bibedo kwedwu.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwoc pi mot ma jo Pilipi gucwalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />An atye ki yomcwiny matek i Rwot pien kombedi dok wuparo pira kit mayam con. I adane, pe wuweko paro pira, ento kare me konya aye obedo peke botwu. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Dok bene pe akoko can, pien dong apwonye woko ma angeyo ni gin ma atye kwede roma. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Angeyo bedo ki gin manok, dok bene angeyo bedo ki gin mabup. Apwonye me bedo ma cwinya opye ki gin mo keken ma atye kwede, i yengo matek mukato kare, nyo ciro kec, bedo ki lonyo madwong nyo bedo ki can. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Atwero jami ducu liweng pi Kricito ma miya teko.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ento wun yam wutimo ber me ribe kweda i can ma onongo odiya. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2 Kor 11:9</ref> </char></note> Dok wun jo Pilipi wungeyo maber ni, ikare mayam an aa i Makedonia i acaki tito lok me Kwena Maber pe tye lwak mo ikin jo ma oye Rwot ma guribe kweda i yo man me miyo ki gamo mot, ento kono wun keken. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Tic 17:1</ref> </char></note> Kadi wa ikare ma atye i Tecalonika wucwala kony mamite tyen aryo kulu. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Pe tyen loke ni amito mot, ento amitoni wunong gum pa Lubangawu ma a ki imiyo mot ma koni binyayo magoba ma kibikwano botwu. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Nia 29:18</ref> </char></note> Atyeko gamo gin ma wumiya ducu, obedo dwong mukato kare. Oroma dong maber, pien Epaprodito bene omiya mot ma wucwale kwede ni okel bota. Man gin aye gin ma ngwece kur ma kityero bot Lubanga, ma en pwoyo, dok ma yomo cwinye. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Ento Lubangana bimiyowu jami ducu ma wumito, kun kwanyo ki i lonyone me deyo ma en tye kwede i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Deyo obed bot Lubanga Wonwa nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Wumot jo pa Lubanga ducu i Kricito Yecu. Utmega ma gitye kacel kweda kany bene gumotowu. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Jo pa Lubanga ducu gumotowu, makatone jo me ot pa Cecar.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>